      "width": 1440, "height": 3200, "colorSpace": "sRGB", "alpha": false,
      "safeCrop": "中央 72% 保持低对比",
      "promptZh": "抽象生物科技中庭质感，黑绿与深蓝基底，极淡有机曲线和数据脉络，青绿色柔光，少量紫色平衡，纵向深景，中部留白，通用科幻壁纸，无人物无具体建筑无文字无HUD",
      "negativeZh": "森林照片，具体温室建筑，角色，logo，文字，按钮，高饱和荧光绿"
    },
    {
      "id": "TX01", "priority": "P0", "family": "seamless surface textures", "format": "SVG + transparent PNG",
      "deliverables": [
        { "filename": "textures/noise.svg", "storedName": "tex-noise.svg", "size": "256x256 viewBox", "alpha": true, "usageOpacity": "0.025-0.07" },
        { "filename": "textures/grid.svg", "storedName": "tex-grid.svg", "size": "256x256", "alpha": true, "usageOpacity": "0.03-0.09" },
        { "filename": "textures/circuit.svg", "storedName": "tex-circuit.svg", "size": "512x512", "alpha": true, "usageOpacity": "0.025-0.08" },
        { "filename": "textures/scan.svg", "storedName": "tex-scan.svg", "size": "64x64", "alpha": true, "usageOpacity": "0.02-0.06" }
